{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fantasketch&quot; is a new kind of puzzle action game where the characters you draw come to life and move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the shape and color of your self-drawn character to overcome the gimmicks and traps set in each stage! Draw a square for a stable foothold, a circle for easy rolling, and a triangle is perfect for slopes. Furthermore, different colors can make your character burn or stick, making the combination of shape and color the key to conquering each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is developed with the official permission of Kiguteam, the developers of &quot;Stack Graffiti&quot;.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844280?t=1772589968","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3844280?t=1772589968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844280/05f4060422abdd15374bcbeac8aa9555fc56ec1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772589968","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844280/05f4060422abdd15374bcbeac8aa9555fc56ec1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772589968","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fantasketch&quot; is a new kind of puzzle action game where the characters you draw come to life and move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize the shape and color of your self-drawn character to overcome the gimmicks and traps set in each stage! Draw a square for a stabl